xo7ll","contact.followKicker","FOLLOW \u002F 关注我们","FOLLOW US",{"id":600,"documentId":601,"key":602,"zh":603,"en":604,"note":558},100,"a5jnonn1ndreiv5mn36rgu2e","contact.qrWechat","微信公众号","WeChat Official Account",{"pagination":606},{"start":607,"limit":600,"total":608},0,123,{"id":6,"documentId":610,"name":611,"shortName":9,"founded":612,"description":613,"mission":88,"vision":614,"values":615,"address":616,"phone":617,"email":618,"hrEmail":619},"l74kh14nl0pnuwdkyl4jaog5","天津云遥宇航科技有限公司","2019年3月","天津云遥宇航科技有限公司成立于2019年，是一家专业从事气象卫星载荷研发、整星制造、气象数据采集处理、气象应用服务于一体的高新技术企业。公司自主研发GNSS掩星探测载荷系统，成功突破降成本、提性能、增产量、优精度等关键技术难题。截至目前，已成功发射47颗商业气象卫星，是国内最大的商业掩星探测气象星座。","成为世界顶级气象数据运营商","社会责任·用户至上·精益求精·开拓创新·自我驱动·艰苦奋斗","天津市东丽区西六道与保税路交叉口西180米A座云遥宇航","022-00000000","contact@tjyyspace.com","hr@tjyyspace.com",{"data":621,"meta":635},[622],{"id":236,"documentId":623,"title":624,"slug":625,"category":626,"summary":627,"content":628,"publishedDate":629,"enTitle":630,"enSummary":631,"enContent":632,"coverUrl":633,"scheduledPublishAt":634},"bv68dm2g2ou4qumy9afxrmp6","人民日报》专访：《天津云遥宇航科技有限公司创始人李峰辉——“国家的需求，就是我们攻坚的方向”》","news-28","media","2025年08月26日，《人民日报》对云遥宇航创始人李峰辉进行了专访。 李峰辉表示：“国家的需求，就是我们攻坚的方向。”云遥宇航将不断推动小卫星轻量化设计和批量化生产，探索出一条“成本可控、性能优异、应用高效”的商业星座","2025年08月26日，《人民日报》对云遥宇航创始人李峰辉进行了专访。\n\n李峰辉表示：“国家的需求，就是我们攻坚的方向。”云遥宇航将不断推动小卫星轻量化设计和批量化生产，探索出一条“成本可控、性能优异、应用高效”的商业星座模式。目前，云遥宇航建设的商业气象卫星全球组网系统“云遥气象星座”已成功发射46颗气象小卫星，探测精度达世界先进水平。\n\n![](\u002Fmedia\u002Fnews\u002FnewsImg3_260403093419A007.webp)\n\n\n团队提出的构建90颗全球组网星座计划正在稳步推进。该星座建成后，将具备全球大气层实时探测能力，能够以分钟级时间尺度提供预警信息，为防灾减灾、农业气象、航海航空等领域提供支持。\n\n在李峰辉看来，新时代赋予民营企业家更宽广的舞台、更广阔的天地，在新一轮科技革命和产业变革浪潮下，民营企业应成为科技创新大潮中攻坚克难的生力军。","2025-08-26","Interview with People's Daily: \"Li Fenghui, Founder of Tianjin Yunyao Aerospace Technology Co., Ltd. - 'The needs of the country are the direction we are tackling'","On August 26, 2025, People's Daily conducted an exclusive interview with Li Fenghui, the founder of Yunyao Aerospace. Li Fenghui said, \"The needs of the country are the direction w","On August 26, 2025, People's Daily conducted an exclusive interview with Li Fenghui, the founder of Yunyao Aerospace.\n\nLi Fenghui said, \"The needs of the country are the direction we are tackling.\" Yunyao Aerospace will continue to promote lightweight design and mass production of small satellites, exploring a commercial constellation model that is \"cost controllable, high-performance, and efficient in application. At present, the commercial meteorological satellite global networking system \"Yunyao Meteorological Constellation\" constructed by Yunyao Aerospace has successfully launched 46 meteorological small satellites, with detection accuracy reaching the world's advanced level.\n\n![](\u002Fmedia\u002Fnews\u002FnewsImg3_260403093455A008.webp)\n\nThe team's plan to build 90 global network constellations is steadily progressing. After its completion, this constellation will have the ability to detect the global atmosphere in real-time, providing warning information at the minute level, and supporting fields such as disaster prevention and mitigation, agricultural meteorology, navigation and aviation.\n\nIn Li Fenghui's view, the new era has given private entrepreneurs a broader stage and a wider horizon. Under the new wave of technological revolution and industrial transformation, private enterprises should become the driving force to overcome difficulties in the tide of technological innovation.","\u002Fmedia\u002Fnews\u002FmtImg4_260403093210A006.webp",null,{"pagination":636},{"page":6,"pageSize":152,"pageCount":6,"total":6},1783984234905]